    prompt: "You are writing the Guidelines section for [BRAND NAME or WEBSITE URL], for a [CREATOR TYPE] creator, in the [VISUAL FORMAT] format. Output three plain blocks: Make sure you, Do, Don't. Read the review agents and thresholds mapped to the format and translate each into plain creator language, never a number or agent name (hook by 2s becomes \u201chook us in the first couple of seconds\u201d; product visibility 80 becomes \u201ckeep it on screen for most of the video\u201d). Put every threshold-derived instruction in Make sure you. No em dashes."
